{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}_i$", "MATH_0003": "$i \\in I$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X} = \\bigcup_{i \\in I} \\mathcal{X}_i$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{X}_i$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-zariski-open-cover-stack-is-space}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:cdcd6d816063a87d90f948d535062fd01dbb18a101c71062d6a73bf25a294771", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d4259202eb5c1eb7d23caff4903f3ddefd708923b39ddc7d1a36363ce38c07c3", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack.\nLet <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> be a set of open substacks of <MATH_0004>.\nAssume\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005>, and\n<STRUCT_0003> each <MATH_0006> is an algebraic space.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nThen <MATH_0007> is an algebraic space.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c764e886c78fd049cdf48dd17df0aa33328e9b0351846224402e4a3478f72b0f", "unit_id": "tag:05WE:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\coprod_{i \\in I} \\mathcal{X}_i \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\text{id} : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-lemma-stack-in-setoids-descent}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebraic-proposition-algebraic-stack-no-automorphisms}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:83c79c0e368770f6b6974e0adb1b80d22e474d46e77b06eaaa2f335732b5be68", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:61d992d9b7d7228bf3a2bba7dc5e5552fe866c9c0b90b0182eb9c9450169de28", "source_text": "Apply\nStacks, Lemma <REF_0001>\nto the morphism <MATH_0001>\nand the morphism <MATH_0002> to\nsee that <MATH_0003> is a stack in setoids.\nHence <MATH_0004> is an algebraic space, see\nAlgebraic Stacks,\nProposition <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:af46ab3d46619ac548863d47fe6f0bf70cf43b7b4fbfc17136caad24751b8d85", "unit_id": "tag:05WE:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}_i$", "MATH_0003": "$i \\in I$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X} = \\bigcup_{i \\in I} \\mathcal{X}_i$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{X}_i$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-zariski-open-cover-stack-is-scheme}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:cdcd6d816063a87d90f948d535062fd01dbb18a101c71062d6a73bf25a294771", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c32db6be4979ddb24d678869b6308d11f7942f7740ade808a7f5a0a75bf1df3b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack.\nLet <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> be a set of open substacks of <MATH_0004>.\nAssume\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005>, and\n<STRUCT_0003> each <MATH_0006> is a scheme\n<STRUCT_0004>\nThen <MATH_0007> is a scheme.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0b4f518e9f145cda94e420b8041ce40b0cca861ed01bbd8a1b1467551c50a902", "unit_id": "tag:05WF:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-zariski-open-cover-stack-is-space}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-properties-lemma-subscheme}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4358773e0f726710a6901d3f9bc82528765c2521d1b82474222fb40757ece4db", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e25c176a1cb0f35792f0d57538162c4530ae068742f76461e3af5d966a7ff5d9", "source_text": "By\nLemma <REF_0001>\nwe see that <MATH_0001> is an algebraic space. Since any algebraic\nspace has a largest open subspace which is a scheme, see\nProperties of Spaces, Lemma <REF_0002>\nwe see that <MATH_0002> is a scheme.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fbda86f7d1796600c27ac023aa8a062b623aa93a443a7689323a3badadcc7201", "unit_id": "tag:05WF:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{more-groupoids-lemma-local-source}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6cf985a9519213605b41378b6441effae06493fac80ada67207fcdbd19cac7a8", "source_text": "\n\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following lemma is the analogue of\nMore on Groupoids, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6604a248fbf8b784a02f5065526652b6bf0c5f14851301463d38a6fe9e1e4376", "unit_id": "tag:04YK:prose-0006"}
